  "description": "Wild Western Alphabet Lettering ABC Cowboy Text Font OTF – A unique cowboy style font where you can create your own words and colour them to your vision!\nWild Western is a vintage display font that channels classic wood-type posters and saloon signage. Thick stems, flared spurs, and engraved inlines create a hand-tooled feel that jumps off the page for logos, badges, packaging, and event posters. Set it large for instant impact, then layer strokes, drop shadows, or subtle textures to amplify the rugged character. The set includes clean OTF and TTF files with A–Z, numerals, and essential punctuation, carefully spaced for tight headlines and reliable rhythm. Use warm palettes and weathered backgrounds for BBQ brands, country music covers, and rodeo nights—or anywhere a bold frontier voice is needed. Pair with a simple grotesk or condensed serif for supporting copy, adjust tracking from –10 to +40 depending on size, and let Wild Western font bring true Old West swagger to your next layout.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Wild Western Alphabet Lettering ABC Cowboy Text Font OTF – A unique cowboy style font where you can create your own words and colour them to your vision!</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Wild Western is a vintage display font</strong> that channels classic wood-type posters and saloon signage. Thick stems, flared spurs, and engraved inlines create a hand-tooled feel that jumps off the page for logos, badges, packaging, and event posters. Set it large for instant impact, then layer strokes, drop shadows, or subtle textures to amplify the rugged character. The set includes clean OTF and TTF files with A–Z, numerals, and essential punctuation, carefully spaced for tight headlines and reliable rhythm. Use warm palettes and weathered backgrounds for BBQ brands, country music covers, and rodeo nights—or anywhere a bold frontier voice is needed. Pair with a simple grotesk or condensed serif for supporting copy, adjust tracking from –10 to +40 depending on size, and let <strong>Wild Western font </strong>bring true Old West swagger to your next layout.</p>",
